        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A nesting basket set is three round baskets in super-chunky rope on a 10 mm hook. Each starts with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-nest"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and uses the same increase pattern, stopped at a different round for each size. A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blo-nest"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "BLO fold round"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " marks the base edge before the sides go straight up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The three sizes nest inside each other when not in use. Total yardage is around 60 m (small), 100 m (medium), and 160 m (large)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
